// Summon Spirit Sphere (MO_CALLSPIRITS) - the reference has no cast artwork (the
// sphere orbit is its own system), so this is a quiet authored flourish: a blue
// glow contracts into the chest while six motes converge on it, then a small
// condensation flash and glint. Reused by Absorb-style spirit skills (Zen 401,
// Ki Translation 1015, Soul Change 374). ~0.65s.
// Coordinates follow inc_agi.strfx.ron: (319, 291) is the unit's feet, smaller
// y is higher, 1024 angle units per turn. The body spans about y 191..291.
(
    fps: 30,
    layers: [
        // Ki glow contracting into the chest.
        (
            textures: ["ro://data/texture/effect/glow11.bmp"],
            blend: Add,
